### **Architecture Summary**

**Hover Flow:**
```
Mouse Pointer Over Mesh
  ↓
ModelPiece.handlePointerEnter()
  ↓
useDesignAppHoverPiece()(pieceGuid)  [Action Hook]
  ↓
actor.send({ type: "DESIGN.SET_HOVER", hover: { pieces: [pieceGuid] } })
  ↓
DesignStore state updated
  ↓
computeHoverData() recomputed
  ↓
HoverPiecesContext.transitivelyHoveredPieces updated
  ↓
useDesignAppIsPieceTransitiveHovered() subscribers re-render
  ↓
ModelPiece.isHovered = true
  ↓
Geometry component receives hovered={true}
  ↓
resolvedColor/resolvedEmissiveColor/resolvedEdgeColor computed from hoverBaseColor
  ↓
meshStandardMaterial color/emissive updated → visual highlight
```

